  "implementation": "Borrowed-only fill/copy/composite validate policies, canvas-first local borrowed capacity and nonempty clipped-region limits directly. Pass the same CancellationToken through unchanged kernels/checkpoints. No OperationContext allocation/disposal, budget calls, temporary pixel storage, new owner/quota/session abstraction or common codec-context change. Intrinsic positive dimensions,8/16bit depth and array-sized capacity follow from the existing ImageBuffer and clipped-region invariants.",
  "boundaries": "Complete original public in-place operations on borrowed canvases, with all actual validation, clipping/normalization, alias handling, cooperative cancellation and cleanup included. Source/canvas preparation remains outside both clocks. Copy/fill repeated overwrites are idempotent; overlap is two public moves with reverse restoration against six native directional bands. Compositing retains original per-operation resets outside clocks, invocation/unroll1 and approved native bounds. Current wrapper/input/graph retention remains as originally documented. No encoder, resize or font/text pipeline timing changes.",
